# TMS Working Memory

Last reconciled: 2026-08-02
Repository: `https://github.com/lucazsoft/tution-Management-System/`
Branch: `main`
Repository baseline: `bba14be janitor ui/ux` (2026-07-31)
Worktree at reconciliation: clean

## Documentation authority

This file is the repository's operational source of truth for the current
implementation state, verified validation status, known gaps, and next work.
Read it before development and update it in the same change set whenever those
facts change.

- `README.md` is the entry point and must link to the current documents.
- `documents/auth-docs/AUTH_AND_AUTHORIZATION_HANDOFF.md` is the active,
  detailed runbook for authentication and authorization only.
- The documents under `documents/code-audits/` and
  `documents/auth-docs/audit-auth-security.md` are historical assessments.
  They provide context but do not override this file or describe the current
  release posture.

